  Description: A person cannot live on fish alone, which is why you work with Elder
    Bo'Mel on her farm. Elder Ordwi asked you to accompany her to Iron Harbor because
    she values your input in evaluating how the village might be making use of their
    natural resources. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Constitution
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Nature skill and the
    Architecture Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Natural
    Medicine] skill feat.
